@startuml purchase-request-state
title Purchase Request — Canonical V1 Lifecycle
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> SUBMITTED : submit
SUBMITTED --> CHANGES_PROPOSED : propose material change
CHANGES_PROPOSED --> SUBMITTED : resolve accepted change
SUBMITTED --> CONVERTED : convert to Sales Order
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : reject with reason
SUBMITTED --> WITHDRAWN : Buyer withdraws
SUBMITTED --> EXPIRED : expiresAt reached
CHANGES_PROPOSED --> REJECTED : reject with reason
CHANGES_PROPOSED --> WITHDRAWN : Buyer withdraws
CHANGES_PROPOSED --> EXPIRED : expiresAt reached

CONVERTED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
WITHDRAWN --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]

note right of SUBMITTED
Only persisted Purchase Request states:
SUBMITTED, CHANGES_PROPOSED, CONVERTED,
REJECTED, WITHDRAWN, EXPIRED.
RequestDraft is a separate Aggregate Root.
end note
@enduml
